                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.00/8072: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Lane</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-06-25T12:00:00-06:00">June 25,
                        1934—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received 1:55 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>134. Statement as approved by the Department’s 38, June 23 [<hi
                        rendition="#italic">24</hi>], 3 [<hi rendition="#italic">5</hi>] p.m., being
                    released for publication in the local press this evening.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lane</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
